  "notes": "Registration opens January 4, 2027. Camp 9 am to 3:15 pm; free early arrival from 8 am, pick up 3:30 to 3:45 pm. Campers attend 1 to 7 weeks; discount for four or more weeks. Week 2 runs four days (closed July 5) and the page does not say whether its price differs, so it has no price here. After Camp Care to 6 pm is $125 a week or $25 a drop in day. Bus from Center City, South Philadelphia, Spruce Hill, Fairmount and the Main Line (Bala Cynwyd, Narberth, Merion Station, Wynnewood) is $130 a week ($65 for each added sibling). CIT program for rising 7th and 8th graders who were campers. The refund table on the page still carries 2026 dates.",
